height:20px;width:auto;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-align: left; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">这个我天子我P过，我只能对U的勇士，表示真正的敬意。我向你∠(°ゝ°)。</span></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; text-align: left; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">总所周知 奶量可以根据攻击力提升效果，奶量也可以暴击。毒奶也是如此。当你暴击时候，你的基础伤害造成了暴击，你的毒奶也能暴击，双重暴击伤害，伤害十分可观。此时队友回复的奶量也能暴击。</span></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">P的时候，暴击时自己奶 6000~7000 ，毒奶毒对面6000~7000 ，点火更加可怕，推荐 红防 红攻 白暴击/白攻击/HP</span></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">我致敬你真正的为了乐趣而玩，不仅仅是纯粹的主流的玩法。</span></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><br></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">&nbsp;---奶牛 2021.06.24</span></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><br></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\"><br></div>\n                  <i class=\"border-i-top\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);z-index:2147483647;\"></i><i class=\"border-i-right\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);z-index:2147483647;\"></i><i class=\"border-i-bottom\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);z-index:2147483647;\"></i><i class=\"border-i-left\" contenteditable=\"false